stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> OPEN: C1 · product-caused miss recorded or the tenant opens a claim
    OPEN --> CLASSIFIED: C2 · root cause confirmed and miss_class set
    CLASSIFIED --> DECLINED: C3 · tenant-caused or authority-caused or an exclusion applies
    CLASSIFIED --> ACCEPTED: C4 · product-caused
    DECLINED --> DISPUTED: C5 · tenant disputes inside the dispute window
    ACCEPTED --> DISPUTED: C5 · tenant disputes the amount
    DISPUTED --> ACCEPTED: C6 · re-review by a person other than the classifier
    DISPUTED --> DECLINED: C6 · re-review upholds the decline
    ACCEPTED --> SETTLED: C7 · remedy paid or credited inside the cap version in force
    SETTLED --> [*]
    DECLINED --> [*]

    note right of CLASSIFIED
        Evidence is assembled at C1, never at C4.
        A record we were obliged to keep and did not
        decides the miss as product-caused.
    end note
